## The steps!

1. Search for your ASUS ROG system’s model number [here](https://www.asus.com/uk/support/download-center/)
2. You may see a list of available drivers, click `EXPAND ALL`
3. If you have Armoury Crate already installed then uninstall this and search for `Armoury Crate & Aura Creator Installer` in the driver page – download and install this – do NOT download it from the generic Armoury Crate page!
4. Now download and install the `Armoury Crate Control Interface` driver (NB. there may be multiple versions, but I found installing Version 1 works)
5. Now download and install the `ASUS Smart Display Control` driver
6. Restart your system and you are done!

Here’s what it should look like after if everything is working:

